{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Add Device" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "添加设备" } } } },
    "Check for Device" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "检查设备" } } } },
    "Copy Pairing Code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "复制配对码" } } } },
    "Device Paired" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "设备已配对" } } } },
    "Expires" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "失效时间" } } } },
    "For multiple SIMs, create a separate code, container, state volume, and hardware mapping for each modem." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如有多张 SIM，请为每只通信模块分别创建配对码、容器、状态卷和硬件映射。" } } } },
    "Generate New Code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "生成新配对码" } } } },
    "Generating a secure code…" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "正在生成安全配对码…" } } } },
    "Linux Device" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Linux 设备" } } } },
    "Mount the secret in the container" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "将 secret 挂载到容器" } } } },
    "Names and phone numbers are encrypted on this iPhone before upload." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "设备名称和电话号码会先在这台 iPhone 上加密，再上传到后台。" } } } },
    "No Devices" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暂无设备" } } } },
    "No new device found yet." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暂未发现新设备。" } } } },
    "One-Time Pairing Code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一次性配对码" } } } },
    "Pair one Linux modem container for each SIM you want to use." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "为每张要使用的 SIM 配对一个 Linux 通信模块容器。" } } } },
    "Pairing code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "配对码" } } } },
    "Pairing code copied." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "配对码已复制。" } } } },
    "Remove Device" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "移除设备" } } } },
    "Remove this device?" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "移除此设备？" } } } },
    "Removing a device disconnects it immediately. Pair it again with a new code and an empty state volume." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "移除后设备会立即断开。如需再次使用，请用新配对码和空状态卷重新配对。" } } } },
    "Restore the encryption key before editing this device." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "请先恢复加密密钥，再编辑此设备。" } } } },
    "SIM %lld is ready to configure." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "SIM %lld 已可配置。" } } } },
    "Save the code as a Docker secret" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "将配对码保存为 Docker secret" } } } },
    "Start one container for this modem" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "为这只通信模块启动一个容器" } } } },
    "The code expires after ten minutes and can pair only one modem." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "配对码将在十分钟后失效，并且只能配对一只通信模块。" } } } },
    "The modem credential will stop working immediately. This action cannot be undone." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "通信模块凭据会立即失效，此操作无法撤销。" } } } },
    "Try Again" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "重试" } } } },
    "Unnamed Device" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "未命名设备" } } } },
    "Use unique device mappings and a unique state volume." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用独立的设备映射和状态卷。" } } } },
    "·" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "·" } } } },
    "API" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "API" } } } },
    "APN" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "APN" } } } },
    "About" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "关于" } } } },
    "Account" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "账户" } } } },
    "Active" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已启用" } } } },
    "After reinstalling, sign in with your passkey and restore the encryption key from iCloud Keychain." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "重新安装后，请使用通行密钥登录，并从 iCloud 钥匙串恢复加密密钥。" } } } },
    "Back" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "返回" } } } },
    "Call and message through your own SIM devices while your numbers and conversations remain end-to-end encrypted." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "通过你自己的 SIM 设备通话和收发短信，同时让号码与会话保持端到端加密。" } } } },
    "Choose the SIM that places each call." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "为每次通话选择拨出 SIM。" } } } },
    "Connect Your Server" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "连接你的后台" } } } },
    "Continue" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "继续" } } } },
    "If iCloud recovery is unavailable, another trusted iPhone or the Linux host must approve this installation. A reinstalled app always receives a new installation identity." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果无法使用 iCloud 恢复，必须由另一台可信 iPhone 或 Linux 主机批准此安装。重新安装的 App 始终会获得新的安装身份。" } } } },
    "Keep conversations separated by SIM." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "按 SIM 分开保存会话。" } } } },
    "Private by design" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "隐私优先设计" } } } },
    "Protect App Reinstallation" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保护 App 重装恢复" } } } },
    "Set Up Later" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "稍后设置" } } } },
    "Setup progress" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "设置进度" } } } },
    "Step %lld of %lld" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步" } } } },
    "The server relays encrypted data it cannot read." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "后台只转发无法读取的加密数据。" } } } },
    "Welcome to sim-deck" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "欢迎使用 sim-deck" } } } },
    "Your calls" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "你的通话" } } } },
    "Your messages" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "你的短信" } } } },
    "Your server manages trusted iPhones and SIM devices without receiving message or call content." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "你的后台负责管理可信 iPhone 和 SIM 设备，但不会接收短信或通话内容。" } } } },
    "Admin bootstrap password" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "管理员初始密码" } } } },
